EN 40Gbps USB4 NVMe Enclosure\"]\ue201 \u2014 Best overall**\n\n40Gbps \u00b7 USB4 / Thunderbolt \u00b7 \\~3,000\u20133,800 MB/s peak\n\nExcellent performance and passive cooling. Tom's Hardware found it faster in sustained transfers than the OWC and Cable Matters models it tested. \ue200cite\ue202turn352407search3\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Sabrent EC-SNVE tool free USB C M.2 SSD enclosure product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**2\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn352407product19\",\"SABRENT USB 3.2 Type-C Tool-Free Enclosure for M.2 PCIe NVMe\u2026\"]\ue201 \u2014 Best for most people**\n\n10Gbps \u00b7 USB-C \u00b7 \\~1,000 MB/s\n\nTool-free, supports both NVMe and SATA M.2 drives, and works with common SSD sizes."},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics/0/line","o":"replace","v":28},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics/0/column","o":"replace","v":7},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/a588d0a9-b3f2-5d84-b96a-e7dbc7573701/state/is_loading","o":"replace","v":false},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/a588d0a9-b3f2-5d84-b96a-e7dbc7573701/state/images","o":"append","v":[{"url":"https://uk.ugreen.com/products/m2-nvme-ssd-enclosure-40gbps-8tb","content_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/BR4nIXviApkImZjUC-9zGyHqL9EqgoPdbWBtZcfJxEyEEv4qvy6KFOUyPvl4FTGyY5qXU4g0XvosQV-GrPnmyPXyTTG1Wu7xjDjUMtmczOoqBcFwRzyKHFNXh_K3ddyPu8q-t4XmKI7_few5LVeKs36KI09JLJK7WBzZ6THhLZEDTZ1Wa5WIa3_7Y4JsmOZl?purpose=fullsize","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/z6Vdm9bDyADSE8JwSM1UliwmEdlDS4LEv0dhej_go-Ln5fnLx3LEmdn_wvy8or6pYjeudi4ROa_5Ha2hE3UpO7LZ-Un4QnXHNJqDQjZkSGWjCEHlnBakvCerGSirFQfpKgcUqP5wuNeZFBoBGcS8hLMJ9Kjob7kN5iMC0_8ccQ4?purpose=inline","original_content_url":"https://uk.ugreen.com/cdn/shop/files/20251020152930_16715_1.png?v=1760946557","save_target":"image","title":"UGREEN M.2 NVMe SSD 