allbackMarkdown","o":"replace","v":"# Best NVMe SSD Enclosures in 2026\n\nBased on current web search results and hands-on testing from \ue200entity\ue202[\"organization\",\"Tom's Hardware\"]\ue201, my top recommendation is the **UGREEN 40Gbps USB4 NVMe enclosure** for performance, or the **Sabrent EC-SNVE** if you just need an affordable, reliable enclosure.\n\n## Top picks\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"UGREEN 40Gbps USB4 M.2 NVMe SSD enclosure aluminum finned heatsink\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**1\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"product\",\"UGREEN 40Gbps USB4 NVMe Enclosure\"]\ue201 \u2014 Best overall**\n\n40Gbps \u00b7 USB4 / Thunderbolt \u00b7 \\~3,000\u20133,800 MB/s peak\n\nExcellent performance and passive cooling. Tom's Hardware found it faster in sustained transfers than the OWC and Cable Matters models it tested. \ue200cite\ue202turn352407search3\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Sabrent EC-SNVE tool free USB C M.2 SSD enclosure product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**2\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn352407product19\",\"SABRENT USB 3.2 Type-C Tool-Free Enclosure for M.2 PCIe NVMe\u2026\"]\ue201 \u2014 Best for most people**\n\n10Gbps \u00b7 USB-C \u00b7 \\~1,000 MB/s\n\nTool-free, supports both NVMe and SATA M.2 drives, and works with common SSD sizes.\n\n\\$44.99 at newegg.com\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"OWC Express 1M2 USB4 NVMe SSD enclosure aluminum heatsink\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**3\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"product\",\"OWC Express 1M2\"]\ue201 \u2014 Best premium fanless**\n\n40Gbps \u00b7 USB4 \u00b7 up to \\~3,800 MB/s\n\nSubstantial aluminum heatsink, silent operation, and a good option for Mac or PC workflows. \ue200cite\ue202turn352407search4\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Sabrent EC-U4TN USB4 40Gbps NVMe SSD enclosure cooling fan\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**4\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"product\",\"Sabrent EC-U4TN\"]\ue201 \u2014 Best for active cooling**\n\n40Gbps \u00b7 USB4 \u00b7 up to 3,900 MB/s advertised\n\nBuilt-in fan and tool-free installation. Good for large file transfers, although the fan adds noise. \ue200cite\ue202turn352407search5\ue201\n\n## Which speed should you buy?\n\n| Interface | Typical real-world peak | Best for |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| USB 10Gbps | 900\u20131,050 MB/s | Backups, everyday storage |\n| USB 20Gbps | 1,600\u20132,000 MB/s | Faster USB transfers |"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/6a501449-4b60-543b-91b6-71a191bd9f68/state/is_loading","o":"replace","v":false},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/6a501449-4b60-543b-91b6-71a191bd9f68/state/images","o":"append","v":[{"url":"https://downloads.sabrent.com/product/ec-u4tn-user-manual-english/","content_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/iHHvcH2VB5DMUBPGumrmHf39hyqgCVgQSynmLzX-_NRpE0p-LZIvRec2_c3knYtVWno1_NOJ_Mjj0zJod6TgjJJVeAcoArGiQ3kUzqR0UEaeMMIZL9Dj_ubKfDK9a7rfbSErESyPgl2xfpV18MNugXL4bLSctTcVYfZmx1I8n909HTXHIVB93aHtGoI7SOnB?purpose=fullsize","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/7Z5qUqx7DLg4-uLyZfaNLjgURautREzGjHAdR-ZaG3uyIRz5r1qkblExlEIHwkrEyqKvOpPTEwGOE0vkamYBmKb9imDbygGiuv1Z53V0KpRgmDMNcRle2YdbQ-I7H2XnGpvnQTa9i0zF4v4rze4eqrslTB6cZqxhtGvpiPHPF0U?purpose=inline","original_content_url":"https://s39916.pcdn.co/wp-content/uploads/Main-4-1536x1536.jpg","save_target":"image","title":"EC-U4TN \u2013 User Manual [English] \u2013 Sabrent Downloads","image_search_query":"Sabrent EC-U4TN USB4 40Gbps NVMe SSD enclosure cooling fan","show_url":true,"content_size":{"width":1536,"height":1536},"thumbnail_size":{"width":1024,"height":1024},"thumbnail_crop_info":{"center_x_percent":0.2688802083333333,"center_y_percent":0.763671875},"shop_eligible":true}]},{